course: dictionary
lesson: 12526
title: Formal words: desist
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Desist is a formal word that means to stop doing something, especially when someone tells you to. You will meet it in letters, notices and courtrooms, where people speak in a careful, stiff way. «The sign said: Please desist from feeding the ducks.» The sign wants you to stop feeding them.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. Who is speaking, and what do they want? In «The judge told the man to desist from shouting in court», a judge is giving an order, so desist means stop, and it means stop now.
explain: «Cease and desist» is a legal phrase that means stop completely. You do not need to use it in everyday talk. At home, you would say «stop» or «quit it» instead, and both mean the same as desist.
fact: Desist means to stop doing something, especially when you are told to.
fact: Desist is a formal word, so it is used in letters, notices and official warnings.
fact: «Cease and desist» means stop completely.
fact: In everyday talk, people say «stop» or «quit it» instead of desist.
exercise: «The sign said: Please desist from feeding the ducks.» What does desist mean here? | Swim after them | *Stop doing it | Run away | Feed them more
exercise: Find and copy one word that is another form of desist in this sentence: «The boys desisted at once when Mum called.» | called | *desisted | Mum | boys
exercise: In everyday talk people say "quit it" instead of desist. Which everyday word means the same as desist? | Eat | *Stop | Shout | Jump
test: «The judge ordered the crowd to desist from shouting.» Why would a judge use the word desist? | Because it means to be happy | Because judges like to sing | *Because it is a formal word for stop | Because it means to start
test: Which sentence uses desist correctly? | *Please desist from running in the corridor | Desist is a red bicycle | The dog desisted the ball | We desist the rain every day
exam: «The letter said: You must desist from using our logo.» What does the letter want you to do? | *Stop using the logo | Copy it again | Send a gift | Draw a bigger logo
